1646	 * Run the full editorial board in parallel — convene the room. Each
1647	 * persona reads the same brief + draft and returns a single note. The
1648	 * caller is expected to choose anchor sentences client-side and pass
1649	 * them in `anchors[personaId]`. Falls back to the local generator for
